<title>UK: LME publishes May TAPOs settlement prices.</title>
<headline>LME publishes May TAPOs settlement prices.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) monthly average settlement prices for copper and primary aluminium TAPOs for May were as follows.</p>
<p>    Copper-Grade A    - $2,514.33</p>
<p>Primary Aluminium - $1,625.65.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
